  "notes": "Warm off-white page (#f4f2ec) with white rounded panels and deep forest-green primary (#1f5c4a) on every row's 'Submit · 45' button; amber banner and warning pills for deadline and low DNA yield. Numbers lead each cell with small muted units ('9 mm', '41 ng/µL'), and thin green data bars under inhibition zones. Team notes are attributed by bolded first name and truncated with ellipsis. Right aside pairs a 6-segment credit meter (6×45=270, hatched '30 left over' segment) with Available/Reserved/Spent stats and a 6-slot submission tray of dashed numbered placeholders; when filled, slots show isolate summary with Swap/Withdraw and the table row turns pale green with '✓ Reserved / Withdraw'. Reserve-until-cutoff commitment model is the core idea (proposal filed: commitment-budget-tray). Row ID opens a right detail drawer with scrim; submitting shows bottom-centre dark success toast."
